{"unit_id":"kk3ya03-star__dsh-lcx-codex#feature-1","repo":"kk3ya03-star/dsh-lcx-codex","commit":"cf54484b7bce1bfee4e5681856f39f003dea0dec","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"LCX Codex 的功能「GPT Hosted 搜索」：将 DSH 的 web_search 请求交给当前 GPT Responses 路由，返回网页来源、引用和可选图片结果；高级设置可按域名或位置筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/web-search-hosted.ts:25-26","src/index.ts:2323-2325"]}
